{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0411-s001", "text": "När en människa avlider, lämnar hen ofta efter sig egendom, till exempel pengar eller en bostad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0411-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.249908447265625, "generation_seconds": 26.725576424971223, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0411-s002", "text": "Den avlidnes egendom kallas arv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0411-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.2043537414965986, "peak": 0.4307861328125, "generation_seconds": 9.421069974079728, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0411-s003", "text": "Enligt lagen delas arvet mellan arvingarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0411-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.3416748046875, "generation_seconds": 13.184390967013314, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0411-s004", "text": "Arvingar är enligt lagen i första hand den avlidnes barn, eller om något av barnet har dött, barnbarnen, deras barn och så vidare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0411-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.075918367346938, "peak": 0.38482666015625, "generation_seconds": 45.53920000605285, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0411-s005", "text": "Om den avlidne inte har några barn, är maken eller makan, föräldrarna, syskonen, syskonens barn, far- och morföräldrarna eller i sista hand mostrar och fastrar, morbröder och farbröder arvingar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0411-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.50938775510204, "peak": 0.305572509765625, "generation_seconds": 67.61199779016897, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0411-s006", "text": "Den avlidnes kusiner är inte arvingar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0411-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.5526530612244898, "peak": 0.355743408203125, "generation_seconds": 18.73441622289829, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0412-s001", "text": "Före sin död kan en människa också upprätta ett testamente, där hen förordnar hur hens egendom ska delas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0412-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.26947021484375, "generation_seconds": 35.809938692022115, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0412-s002", "text": "Finlands lag förskriver ändå att den avlidnes barn har rätt till åtminstone hälften av det belopp som de enligt lag skulle få om det inte fanns något testamente.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T033828616152Z/hb-c09-u0412-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.096054421768708, "peak": 0.289642333984375, "generation_seconds": 48.3770687719807, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0412-s003", "text": "Detta är fallet även om den avlidne genom testamente skulle förordna sin egendom till någon annan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0412-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.254791259765625, "generation_seconds": 29.45933900005184, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0413-s001", "text": "I Finland har det funnits lika arvsrätt sedan år 1878.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0413-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.314300537109375, "generation_seconds": 25.480703423032537, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0413-s002", "text": "Lika arvsrätt betyder att kvinnor och män har samma rätt till arv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0413-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.4490966796875, "generation_seconds": 26.736711492063478, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0413-s003", "text": "Om en avliden person inte har några arvingar och inte har upprättat något testamente, går hens egendom till staten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0413-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.313934326171875, "generation_seconds": 44.51362519105896, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0414-s001", "text": "När ett arv delas ordnas en bouppteckning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0414-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.308349609375, "generation_seconds": 17.55222221184522, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0414-s002", "text": "En bouppteckning är en tillställning där man utreder den avlidnes tillgångar och skulder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0414-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.289459228515625, "generation_seconds": 27.61801834986545, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0414-s003", "text": "Tillställningen ordnas vanligtvis av den avlidnes änka eller änkling eller barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0414-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.2530517578125, "generation_seconds": 26.223832449875772, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0414-s004", "text": "Den måste ordnas inom tre månader efter dödsfallet och samtliga av den avlidnes arvingar ska bjudas in till den.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T034336621281Z/hb-c09-u0414-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.336578369140625, "generation_seconds": 34.83051134692505, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0415-s001", "text": "Vid bouppteckningen gör man upp en förteckning över den avlidnes egendom, det vill säga dödsboet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0415-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.35723876953125, "generation_seconds": 29.04349470906891, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0415-s002", "text": "Förteckningen över den avlidnes egendom kallas för en bouppteckningshandling.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0415-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.3721923828125, "generation_seconds": 22.925287279998884, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0415-s003", "text": "Handlingen kan upprättas av en anställd person, till exempel en advokat, eller någon av arvingarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0415-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.125442176870749, "peak": 0.328399658203125, "generation_seconds": 31.86233603209257, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0415-s004", "text": "I bouppteckningshandlingen antecknas den avlidnes förmögenhet och skulder, uppgifter om hens arvingar och innehållet i testamentet, om ett sådant finns.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0415-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.538775510204081, "peak": 0.302001953125, "generation_seconds": 38.205722152022645, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0416-s001", "text": "Arvingarna ansvarar inte för skulder som den avlidne lämnar efter sig, så länge som skulderna är korrekt antecknade i bouppteckningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0416-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.145578231292516, "peak": 0.4005126953125, "generation_seconds": 31.224758357042447, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0417-s001", "text": "Vem som ärver egendom efter en avliden person fastställs i lagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0417-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.353912353515625, "generation_seconds": 18.361087032826617, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0417-s002", "text": "Du kan även själv påverka till vilka personer din egendom fördelas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0417-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.323699951171875, "generation_seconds": 20.315014738822356, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0417-s003", "text": "Du kan skriva ett testamente, som är en skriftlig redogörelse över vem som ärver dina ägodelar efter din bortgång.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035100894941Z/hb-c09-u0417-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.306732177734375, "generation_seconds": 36.562275731004775, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0417-s004", "text": "Ett testamente ska innehålla vissa punkter och det ska alltid undertecknas av två ojäviga vittnen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035526881363Z/hb-c09-u0417-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.446075439453125, "generation_seconds": 24.55241580796428, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0417-s005", "text": "Annars är testamentet inte legitimt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035526881363Z/hb-c09-u0417-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4829931972789114, "peak": 0.497528076171875, "generation_seconds": 10.990863719023764, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0417-s006", "text": "Det är alltså tillrådligt att ta hjälp av en jurist när du ska skriva testamente.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035526881363Z/hb-c09-u0417-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.364654541015625, "generation_seconds": 16.9656065760646, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0418-s001", "text": "I Finland finns det två arvsskatteklasser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035526881363Z/hb-c09-u0418-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.1099319727891155, "peak": 0.343780517578125, "generation_seconds": 9.332454093033448, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0418-s002", "text": "Den avlidnes närmaste släktingar, till exempel barn, barnbarn och make eller maka, betalar mindre skatt på sina respektive arv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035526881363Z/hb-c09-u0418-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.936598639455783, "peak": 0.2938232421875, "generation_seconds": 28.58243239321746, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0418-s003", "text": "Om arvingen är mer avlägset släkt eller inte alls släkt med den avlidne, är skatten högre.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035526881363Z/hb-c09-u0418-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.32666015625, "generation_seconds": 22.457352755125612, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0418-s004", "text": "Skatteprocenten är också högre ju större arvet är.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-arv/narration-resume-20261103T035526881363Z/hb-c09-u0418-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.402099609375, "generation_seconds": 13.409940282115713, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
